---
import SectionLabel from "../../elements/SectionLabel.astro";
import Heading from "../../elements/Heading.astro";
import BodyText from "../../elements/BodyText.astro";
import CTAButton from "../../elements/CTAButton.astro";
import { SITE, YEARS_MARRIED } from "../../config/site";
---

<section class="py-20 md:py-32">
  <div
    class="container-default grid grid-cols-1 gap-12 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16 lg:items-center"
  >
    <figure class="lg:col-span-5" data-reveal>
      <div
        class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[14px] border border-us-brass/50 bg-us-cream dark:bg-us-coal"
      >
        <img
          src="/assets/img/people/clark-and-carrie-2.jpg"
          alt="Clark and Carrie Sell, founders of Unspecified Software Co."
          width="900"
          height="1200"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
          class="block w-full h-auto aspect-3/4 object-cover"
        />
      </div>
      <figcaption
        class="mt-4 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-us-ink/50 dark:text-us-paper/50"
      >
        Clark &amp; Carrie Sell
      </figcaption>
    </figure>

    <div class="lg:col-span-7 lg:pl-4">
      <div data-reveal>
        <SectionLabel number="04" text="Who we are" />
      </div>

      <Heading size="md" class="mt-8 max-w-[20ch]" data-reveal>
        Two people, one company, and a very specific reason for building it.
      </Heading>

      <BodyText class="mt-8 max-w-[56ch]" data-reveal>
        Unspecified is run by Clark and Carrie Sell. Clark has spent more than
        25 years building software, from enterprise engineering to founding THAT
        Conference, one of the largest community-run technology conferences in
        the country. Carrie runs the company's operations.
      </BodyText>

      <BodyText class="mt-5 max-w-[56ch]" data-reveal>
        They've been together since {SITE.story.togetherSince} and married for
        {YEARS_MARRIED} years. That's where Troth comes from.
      </BodyText>

      <div class="mt-10" data-reveal>
        <CTAButton href="/about" variant="link">More about us</CTAButton>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
